      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Intake\nWebsite form (webhook) or Telegram bot → classify → reply to website + log to Google Sheet + route.\n\n- **urgent**: Telegram customer → owner gets the AI draft and taps ✅ before it is sent. Website customer → owner is alerted to reply personally.\n- **needs_human**: owner is pinged (model unsure, broken answer, or LLM down).\n- **auto**: customer gets a fixed thank-you, never free AI text.\n- **spam**: logged only.\n\nSetup: fill **Shop settings**, add credentials, and enable **Telegram Trigger** to use the bot.",
